            <p>
                Do you need to screen scrape  data into your database, spreadsheet or any other application? 
                In just minutes, you can use SeeShell to OCR data from all kinds of screens, terminals and dialog boxes
                – automatically and without coding.
            </p>
            <h2>Extract Anything</h2>
            <p>
                SeeShell's screen scraping solution allows you to 
                <span class="hired">visually mark the data</span> that you want to extract ("scrape").
                You simply draw pink frame(s) around the data that you need.
                SeeShell then retrieves the data directly from the desktop with high-quality OCR (Optical Character Recognition).

                The OCR approach works with everything on your screen: Windows app, terminals, RDP sessions,
                Citrix, VM Ware, Vbox,.. so everthing that displays data can be screen scrapeds.
            </p>

